The date a piece of work is due by, stored as `YYYY-MM-DD` — what a date input writes, and a form that sorts and compares as plain text: `[get[due]compare:string:lt[2026-10-01]]`.

Same `applies-filter` as `status`: keep the two in step, and `Field/due/Applies` in each language.
